:name: weact_stm32h743_app
:description: Run the demo application ELF on the WeAct MiniSTM32H743 (no MCUboot).
:
:   tools/debug/renode_run.sh builds the app with renode.overlay/renode.conf
:   and calls this script with:
:
:       renode -e "$bin_path=@.../zephyr.elf" -e "include @.../weact_stm32h743_app.resc"
:
:   Console/shell on UART4: Renode analyzer window + host PTY /tmp/weact_uart4.
:   GDB server on :3333. With $gdb_wait=true the emulation only starts when
:   GDB connects (used by the VS Code debug launch).

$name?="weact_stm32h743"
$bin_path?=@build-renode/app/zephyr/zephyr.elf
$gdb_wait?=false

using sysbus

mach create $name
machine LoadPlatformDescription $ORIGIN/weact_stm32h743.repl

# The flash controller model does not implement every CCR clear-flag bit and
# warns on each flash read; keep only its errors.
logLevel 3 flashController

showAnalyzer uart4
emulation CreateUartPtyTerminal "term_uart4" "/tmp/weact_uart4" true
connector Connect sysbus.uart4 term_uart4

machine StartGdbServer 3333 $gdb_wait

# _vector_table makes the script work for raw (0x08000000) and MCUboot-slot
# (0x08020000 + header) links alike.
macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin_path
    cpu0 VectorTableOffset `sysbus GetSymbolAddress "_vector_table"`
"""

runMacro $reset
